  "description": "This is a detailed outline of the extinction dilution method from:\u00a0\n\nNagasaki, K., and G. Bratbak. 2010. Isolation of viruses infecting photosynthetic and nonphotosynthetic protists, p. 92\u2013101. In S. W. Wilhelm, M. G. Weinbauer, and C. A. Suttle [eds.], Manual of Aquatic Viral Ecology. ASLO.\n\nPlease see the [published manuscript](http://www.aslo.org/books/mave/MAVE_092.pdf) for additional information.",
